msgid "When a hide, a removal, an exile, a suspension or a ban is about you, you are sent the rule, the reason and a link to its line in the Log, with an <b>Appeal</b> button. You can appeal each decision once. The guild's guildmasters decide an appeal against a guild's decision; the site's admins decide the rest. If it is reversed, a new line in the Log says so."
